{% comment %}
The one shell every campaign renders through, whether its body came from a template or from
Markdown. Written once so the parts that must be right every time — the physical address and
the unsubscribe link — cannot be forgotten by whoever writes the body.

MJML compiles this to table-based HTML that survives Outlook's Word renderer. Do not
hand-edit the compiled output; edit here.

Two constraints this is built around:
  - Gmail clips messages over 102KB and hides the rest behind "View entire message" — which
    would hide the unsubscribe link. Keep bodies lean; reference images by URL, never inline.
  - Dark mode inverts unpredictably in Gmail and is ignored by Outlook, so every background
    and text colour is stated rather than left to a default.
{% endcomment %}<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>{{ subject }}</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>{{ preheader }}</mj-preview>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" />
      <mj-text font-size="16px" line-height="1.5" color="#222222" />
      <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" />
    </mj-attributes>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body background-color="#f4f4f4" width="600px">

    {% if site.icon %}
    <mj-section padding="24px 0 8px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="{{ site_icon_url }}" width="48px" alt="{{ site_name }}" />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    {% endif %}

    <mj-section padding="8px 0 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" font-size="13px" color="#888888" letter-spacing="1px">
          {{ site_name|upper }}
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    {{ body_mjml }}

    <mj-section padding="8px 0 32px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-divider border-width="1px" border-color="#e0e0e0" padding="16px 0" />
        {% comment %}
          CAN-SPAM requires a physical postal address in every marketing email. It comes from
          the venue's own record, so a network of galleries each carries the right one
          without anybody remembering to change it.
        {% endcomment %}
        <mj-text align="center" font-size="12px" color="#888888" line-height="1.6">
          {{ site_name }}{% if postal_address %}<br />{{ postal_address }}{% endif %}
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-size="12px" color="#888888">
          You are receiving this because you subscribed at {{ site_name }}.<br />
          <a href="{{ unsubscribe_url }}" style="color:#888888">Unsubscribe</a>
          &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;
          <a href="{{ privacy_url }}" style="color:#888888">Privacy</a>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

  </mj-body>
</mjml>
